# `version` mirrors the in-development version in pyproject.toml (single source of truth;
# tests/test_published_claims.py asserts the two agree).
# `date-released` is deliberately omitted: no `git tag` and no GitHub Release exist for this
# project (a prior 2026-06-30 date here implied a release that never happened, while
# CHANGELOG.md said in the same tree that nothing had been tagged). Add `date-released` back
# only once a version is actually tagged — tests/test_published_claims.py ties its presence to
# a dated release section in CHANGELOG.md, in both directions.
version: 0.1.0
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
